<title>USA: PHLX to list Bank United options, others on Feb 28.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list Bank United options, others on Feb 28.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Tuesday it would begin trading options on Bank United Corp, Millennium Pharmaceuticals Inc and USA Detergents Inc on February 28.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols, the options' strike prices, exercise months, position limits and specialist.</p>
<p>Strikes	 Months	Limits     Specialist</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------</p>
<p>   25, 30, 35    Mar, Apr,   7,500	Westle</p>
<p>		     May, Aug		   Securities</p>
<p>   15, 17-1/2,   Mar, Apr,   4,500	Paul Dry &amp; Co</p>
<p>   20		May, Aug</p>
<p>   22-1/2, 25,   Mar, Apr,   7,500	Westle</p>
<p>   30		May, Aug		   Securities</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
</text>
